            <title>[IGNITE-6805] Tests are red for another MAX_BLOCK_SIZE value (4 or 8 instead 32)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6805</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In SparseDistributedBlockMatrixTest are red next tests&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;testCacheBehaviour&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;testSquareMatrixTimes&lt;br/&gt;
with another value of constant MAX_BLOCK_SIZE (4 or 8, for example)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;In my opinion, it means that algorithm is incorrect for matrices with large number of blocks&lt;/p&gt;</description>
